          <div id='post_1'  class='topic-body crawler-post'>
            <div class='crawler-post-meta'>
              <span class="creator" itemprop="author" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="http://schema.org/Person">
                <a rel='nofollow' href='https://forum.cardano.org/u/Christian_Taylor'><span itemprop="name">Christian_Taylor</span></a>
                  <meta itemprop='url' content='https://forum.cardano.org/u/Christian_Taylor'>
                
              </span>

                <link itemprop="mainEntityOfPage" href="https://forum.cardano.org/t/maintainer-retainer-project-interest-forms-are-live/149244">


              <span class="crawler-post-infos">
                  <time  datetime='2025-09-08T20:20:43Z' class='post-time'>
                    8 September 2025 20:20
                  </time>
                  <meta itemprop='dateModified' content='2025-09-08T20:20:43Z'>
              <span itemprop="position">1</span>
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class='post' itemprop="text">
              <p>We’re officially opening Maintainer Retainer—pairing Cardano projects with paid community maintainers to strengthen releases, documentation, and governance compliance across the ecosystem.<br>
How it works</p>
<ol>
<li>
<p>Projects apply. Submit the interest form so we understand your repos, scope, skills needed, and current governance readiness. → Projects: <a href="https://t.co/rLAoHSUKfN" rel="noopener nofollow ugc">https://forms.clickup.com/9015279944/f/8cnmga8-36875/JR3AS90ED33OUOMN1O</a></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Maintainers apply. Engineers complete the maintainer form and select the projects they’re excited to support. This is coming post project forms.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Match &amp; interview. The Open Source Committee (OSC) and project leads shortlist candidates and run interviews to confirm technical fit, availability, and alignment with Intersect’s open-source governance policy.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Engage &amp; contract. Selected nominees complete a short evaluation period, then support the project under a 12-month full-time contract—focusing on backlog health, release cadence, documentation quality, and instituting governance policy &amp; compliance.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p>All Details here: <a href="https://t.co/gQr2IG62h7" rel="noopener nofollow ugc">https://committees.docs.intersectmbo.org/intersect-open-source-committee/about/paid-open-source-model-posm/maintainer-retainer</a></p>
            </div>

              <div itemprop="interactionStatistic" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="http://schema.org/InteractionCounter">
                  <meta itemprop="interactionType" content="http://schema.org/LikeAction"/>
                  <meta itemprop="userInteractionCount" content="1" />
